@8000 = ~No, perhaps some other time.~

@8001 = ~Yes, go on!~

@8002 = ~What can you do with Snow Leopard Charm?~

@8003 = ~I can combine Snow Leopard Charm, Deep Red Ioun Stone, Lucky Coin of Tymora and Amulet of Protection +1. I will need a Permanency Scroll and 75,000 gold pieces. Do ye want me to continue?~

@8004 = ~With a +3 dagger, Heart of the Golem +2, Stiletto of Demarchess +2, The Grave Binder +2 and Neb's Nasty Cutter, I can forge a very powerful weapon, but it will only be usable by thieves. I'll also need a Manual of Elaboration. It will cost 75,000 gold pieces for ye. Are ye ready?~

@8005 = ~I can combine Boots of The Woodland with a pair of boots of speed and three scrolls of Improved Haste into a pair of boots which will make any ranger who wears them swing faster. I'll also need a Permanency Scroll to make sure that the effect will not gradually fade. It will cost ye 50,000 gold pieces. Are ye ready?~
